# Realtime (client)

- Online: JWT on `handshake.auth.token`, `join_room` with `boardId` string.
- Offline: no JWT. `create_room` / `join_room` with `{ roomCode, userName }`. No REST for workspaces/boards.
- `SyncEngine` dedups `opId`. LWW on `updateObject` via `timestamp`.
- Canvas types `stroke|text|rectangle|circle|line|cursor` and `task` stay in the op log, not `_objects`.
- Cursors: `shouldSaveBackend: false`. Durable ops: `ApiService.saveOperation`.
